# Old Believer

## Lore

The Old Believer is the keeper of the old faith - a combination of shaman, sage
and sorcerer who knows and understands the old superstitions, folk tales and the
lost Russian magic of knots, herbs and Moist Mother Earth. They are also called
Monster Chasers, and the Believers.

He does not study for his magic and he cannot buy it. Once at each new level of
experience he goes to a ley line, fasts and meditates for seven days, and on the
morning of the eighth he simply knows more than he did.

## Alignment

Any, but most are of good alignments.

## GM Notes

This is the source of Nature Magic - the tradition is his, and the book says its
secrets are closely guarded and passed from generation to generation, which is
why 97% of Old Believers are human.

His saving throws are the most specialised in the book: +6 against magical
spoiling, sickness and curses, +7 against disease, +9 against possession. He is
built to survive precisely what the Night Witch does, which is presumably the
point.
